	(text "VBUS is used to sense if USB is connected\nVBUS must not exceed VIO (which is VDD -> which is 3V3 from the internal LDO) +2.5V\nVoltage divider (5V * 47K5) / (22K1 + 47K5) = 3.4V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.386 203.962 0)
		(effects
